WEBVTT

00:08:27.882 --> 00:08:31.461
This compressed curriculum is bad
for all active kids.

00:08:32.486 --> 00:08:34.306
And what happens is,

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:38.990
she says, "Please, sit down,
be quiet, do what you're told,

00:08:39.014 --> 00:08:43.966
follow the rules, manage your time,
focus, be a girl."

00:08:45.309 --> 00:08:46.867
That's what she tells them.

00:08:46.891 --> 00:08:48.976
Indirectly, that's what she tells them.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.060
And so this is a very serious problem.

00:08:51.084 --> 00:08:53.441
Where is it coming from?
It's coming from us.

00:08:53.465 --> 00:08:55.976
(Laughter)

00:08:56.732 --> 00:08:59.700
We want our babies to read
when they are six months old.

00:08:59.724 --> 00:09:00.976
Have you seen the ads?